This project builds on, and credits, the following Apache-2.0 works:

- reachy-motion-generator by Pham Tuan Binh (https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh/reachy-motion-generator):
  the recipe language, its planner prompt, the flow-matching motion generator and the reachability projection,
  vendored unmodified in meme_mirror/vendor/binh (see its LICENSE and README). The model weights are downloaded
  from Hugging Face at first use.
- The in-browser 3D viewer (meme_mirror/web/viewer) from the Hugging Face Space
  binhpham/reachy-mini-motion-generator, with the 3D model, meshes and passive-joint kinematics from
  8bitkick/reachy_mini_3d_web_viz (see LICENSE-reachy_mini_3d_web_viz.txt there).
- Reachy Mini SDK and the Reachy Mini Emotions Library by Pollen Robotics
  (https://github.com/pollen-robotics/reachy_mini,
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-emotions-library).
- Community move datasets Anne-Charlotte/new-emotions and stellaaaa/thinking-animations on Hugging Face.
  catalog.yaml contains features computed from these moves and model-written descriptions of them;
  the motion files themselves are downloaded from Hugging Face at run time.
